<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>JavaScript on Băng Trinh - Developer</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/categories/javascript/</link><description>Recent content in JavaScript on Băng Trinh - Developer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:10:00 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/categories/javascript/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>JavaScript Modules Explained</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-modules-explained/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:10:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-modules-explained/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Modules giúp tách code thành các file reusable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="ví-dụ"&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;math.js&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;) { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;sub&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;) { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;app.js&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt; } &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;./math.js&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;add&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;)); &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Modules giúp tránh global scope pollution và tăng maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>JavaScript Event Loop Demystified</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-event-loop-demystified/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:50:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/javascript-event-loop-demystified/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Event Loop là trái tim của JS runtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="nguyên-lý-hoạt-động"&gt;Nguyên lý hoạt động&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Call Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Nơi lưu function đang chạy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Message Queue&lt;/strong&gt;: Nơi lưu callback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Loop&lt;/strong&gt;: Kiểm tra stack rỗng để xử lý queue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;Start&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;setTimeout&lt;/span&gt;(() =&amp;gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;Timeout&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;End&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="output"&gt;Output&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Start
End
Timeout
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Hiểu event loop giúp debug async code và promise chaining dễ dàng hơn.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Async/Await in JavaScript</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/async-await-in-javascript/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:30:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/async-await-in-javascript/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Async/Await giúp viết code bất đồng bộ trông như đồng bộ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="ví-dụ"&gt;Ví dụ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;async&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fetchData&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;response&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;https://api.example.com/data&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;response&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;json&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; } &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fetchData&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Luôn dùng &lt;code&gt;try/catch&lt;/code&gt; để xử lý lỗi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;await&lt;/code&gt; chỉ dùng trong &lt;code&gt;async&lt;/code&gt; function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Async/await giúp tránh callback hell và code readable hơn.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Understanding JavaScript Closures</title><link>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/understanding-javascript-closures/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 16:10:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://bangtrinh.github.io/my-blog/vi/blogs/understanding-javascript-closures/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Closures là một trong những khái niệm mạnh mẽ nhất trong JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="closure-là-gì"&gt;Closure là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Closure là khi một function nhớ được scope bên ngoài nó ngay cả khi function đó được gọi ở nơi khác:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;makeCounter&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;makeCounter&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt;()); &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;counter&lt;/span&gt;()); &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="mẹo"&gt;Mẹo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dùng closures để tạo private variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tránh lạm dụng closures trong vòng lặp để prevent memory leaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;N.B.&lt;/strong&gt; Closures là chìa khóa để hiểu nhiều pattern trong JS như module hoặc callback.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>